      "definition": "(1) \"Law enforcement officers\" include any undercover drug agent, any bailiff or deputy bailiff of a court of record, and any criminal investigator who is employed by the state public defender.",
      "id": "109.79-law-enforcement-officers",
      "normalized": "law enforcement officers",
      "scope": "(B) As used in this section:",
      "section": "109.79",
